=== What in here is the author's own work ==================================

Substantially all of this project is original work by the author:

  * All source code in this repository.
  * The Warcraft III custom map this game is ported from — its design, systems,
    triggers and balance — and the content derived from it (champions,
    abilities, items, strings, stats).
  * The character models, textures and reskins authored for that map (for
    example the self-made sakura tree, and the unit repaints recorded in
    docs/asset-debt.md as `user-reskin` — the mesh may be stock, the texture is
    the author's).
  * The 21 Chinese voice quips recorded for the map.
  * All eleven background-music tracks, synthesised from scratch by
    tools/bgm-gen — every waveform computed from numpy arrays, with no sample
    and no audio file of any kind read as input.
  * The arena ground textures and the cursor art, generated procedurally by this
    repo's own scripts — no image read as input, byte-reproducible from a seed.

content/assets/CREDITS.md is the detailed provenance record for the above.


=== What in here is NOT the author's =======================================

  * ANIME CHARACTER IDENTITIES. The roster borrows the names, titles,
    likenesses and catchphrases of characters owned by their respective rights
    holders (Shueisha, Shogakukan, Nintendo / The Pokémon Company, and others).
    The models, textures, code and audio are the author's; the characters are
    not. Authoring an original model of someone else's character does not make
    the character the author's.

  * THIRD-PARTY CC0 ART. Models and textures from KayKit (Kay Lousberg),
    Quaternius, Kenney Vleugels and mastjie. Public domain — credited in
    content/assets/CREDITS.md out of courtesy, with no obligation attached.

  * ONE CC BY 4.0 MODEL — ATTRIBUTION IS MANDATORY. The login-screen dragon,
    content/assets/models/menu/dragon2.glb, is not CC0. Its credit must be
    displayed:

      "Animated Dragon Three Motion Loops"
      (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/animated-dragon-three-motion-loops-eca98cf6cd084c1596cecf716e110c29)
      by LasquetiSpice (https://sketchfab.com/LasquetiSpice)
      licensed under CC-BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)

    This obligation exists whether or not the project stays private.

  * 効果音ラボ (Sound Effect Lab) SOUND EFFECTS — https://soundeffect-lab.info/ —
    40 clips under content/assets/audio/sfx/lab/ and audio/voice-jp/. Free for
    commercial use and credit is optional, but copyright is expressly retained
    by 効果音ラボ and the pack's prohibitions apply. It is NOT public domain and
    must not be treated as CC0. See content/assets/CREDITS.md for the verified
    terms.


=== Blizzard assets are NOT in this repository =============================

A local Warcraft III asset overlay (data/blizzard-overlay/, ~84 MB) is used
during development so the map can be viewed as it originally looked. It is
extracted from the author's own installed copy of the game, it is © Blizzard
Entertainment, Inc., and it is EXCLUDED from version control by .gitignore
(/data/**). Keep it that way: never commit it, never ship it, never serve it
publicly. Every asset in it is registered as debt to be replaced —
see docs/asset-debt.md.


=== Practical consequences =================================================

  * Do not make this repository public. The code and art are the author's, but
    the anime character identities are third-party IP regardless of who
    authored the art.
  * Do not deploy it on a publicly reachable network.
  * Do not commit data/blizzard-overlay/.
  * Keep the CC BY 4.0 dragon credit displayed.

If you were given access to contribute: you are working on someone else's
private project. Nothing here grants you rights over the third-party material
named above.

This file records intent and provenance. It is not legal advice.
